                                "sense_id": "a055adec-dd73-39e1-80f9-ef3518cee829",
                                "text": "Together with his mangled Myrmidons, That noseless, handless, hack'd and chipp'd, come to him"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "759099f9-ae76-3cca-82fd-2bccd487aaad",
                        "entry_id": "b27ce43c-dfa3-3b60-8faf-23d6f6905470",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Not handy; awkward."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b237d7d8-2a80-4d1a-8958-fa562146e3f4",
                                "sense_id": "759099f9-ae76-3cca-82fd-2bccd487aaad",
                                "text": "We’ll take a dram for luck, and as soon as this handless man of mine has the collops ready, we’ll dine and take a hand at the cartes as gentlemen should."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2e1548de-19bf-4c2d-842c-e8f0fe814965",
                                "sense_id": "759099f9-ae76-3cca-82fd-2bccd487aaad",
                                "text": "This, however, was a thing that, left to himself, would have simply rendered Bill Lampiere a most handless workman at everything he attempted."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
